# MedSync Health, Inc.
## Hiring Plan - FY 2025
**Document ID**: HR-005
**Classification**: Internal - Confidential
**Approved Date**: December 15, 2024

---

## Executive Summary

MedSync will grow from 1,200 to 1,550 employees in FY 2025, adding 350 net new hires. This represents 29% headcount growth to support our $265M revenue target (69% YoY growth).

---

